function.note:
Assembles de novo peptide sequences against known antibody gene segments to reconstruct complete antibody sequences.
For batch file (job file) specifications, see https://github.com/snijderlab/stitch/blob/master/BatchFiles.md.
Options:
--expect - The expected result(s) of the run as the final sequence(s) by separated commas, used for automated testing;
--open - Open the HTML report (if available) automatically in the browser;
--live - Prepare the HTML report for use with VS Code Live Server on the given port, -1 turns it off;
--quiet - Turns off any output on the command line in normal operation.
